---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navigation from '../components/Navigation.astro';
import ThemeToggle from '../components/ThemeToggle.astro';
import ReadingProgress from '../components/ReadingProgress.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="About - RNZ Blog"
  description="Learn about the person behind RNZ Blog - a developer, automotive enthusiast, and parent sharing insights on programming, tech, cars, and family life."
>
  <Navigation />
  <ThemeToggle />
  <ReadingProgress />
  
  <main class="pt-24 mt-8 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 transition-colors duration-300">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <!-- Hero Section -->
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <div class="w-32 h-32 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-500 to-accent-500 rounded-full mx-auto mb-6 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-4xl font-bold shadow-xl">
          RNZ
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-4">Hi, I'm RNZ</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Developer, automotive enthusiast, and parent navigating the intersection of technology and family life.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Content -->
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 mb-12">
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-4">My Story</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4">
              Welcome to my corner of the internet! I'm a passionate developer who loves exploring the latest in programming, 
              automotive technology, and networking. When I'm not coding or tinkering with cars, I'm probably chasing around 
              my energetic 2-year-old or planning our next family adventure.
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-4">
              This blog is where I share my experiences, insights, and lessons learned across these diverse but interconnected 
              areas of my life. From debugging complex code to understanding the latest EV technology, from setting up home 
              networks to surviving toddler tantrums—it's all here.
            </p>
          </div>
          
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-4">What I Write About</h2>
            <div class="space-y-4">
              <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="text-2xl">💻</div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Programming</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm">Web development, best practices, tutorials, and the latest frameworks</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              
              <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="text-2xl">🚗</div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Automotive Technology</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm">Electric vehicles, car tech, industry trends, and hands-on reviews</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              
              <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="text-2xl">🌐</div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Networking & IT</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm">Home lab setups, network configurations, and IT infrastructure</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              
              <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <div class="text-2xl">👨👩👧👦</div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">Family Life</h3>
                  <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm">Parenting adventures, toddler tips, and balancing work with family</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Skills & Interests -->
        <div class="bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800/50 rounded-2xl p-8 mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-6 text-center">Skills & Interests</h2>
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-3">Programming</h3>
              <ul class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-1 text-sm">
                <li>JavaScript/TypeScript</li>
                <li>React & Astro</li>
                <li>Node.js</li>
                <li>Python</li>
                <li>Web APIs</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-3">Technology</h3>
              <ul class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-1 text-sm">
                <li>Cloud Infrastructure</li>
                <li>Network Security</li>
                <li>Home Automation</li>
                <li>IoT Devices</li>
                <li>System Administration</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-3">Automotive</h3>
              <ul class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-1 text-sm">
                <li>Electric Vehicles</li>
                <li>Automotive Electronics</li>
                <li>Performance Tuning</li>
                <li>Diagnostic Tools</li>
                <li>Industry Analysis</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Personal Touch -->
        <div class="text-center mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-4">Beyond the Code</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            When I'm not writing code or blog posts, you'll find me spending quality time with my family, 
            exploring new places (usually with a very opinionated 2-year-old navigator), or working on 
            various tech projects around the house.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
            I believe that technology should make our lives better, cars should be both fun and efficient, 
            and that there's always something new to learn—whether it's a programming language, 
            a parenting technique, or how to install a car seat correctly on the first try.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Connect Section -->
        <div class="bg-primary-50 dark:bg-primary-900/20 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-4">Let's Connect</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-6">
            I love connecting with fellow developers, automotive enthusiasts, and parents. 
            Feel free to reach out if you want to discuss technology, share parenting tips, 
            or just say hello!
          </p>
          
          <div class="flex justify-center gap-4 mb-6">
            <a href="#" class="bg-blue-500 hover:bg-blue-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-xl transition-colors">
              Twitter
            </a>
            <a href="#" class="bg-blue-700 hover:bg-blue-800 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-xl transition-colors">
              LinkedIn
            </a>
            <a href="#" class="bg-gray-800 dark:bg-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-900 dark:hover:bg-gray-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-xl transition-colors">
              GitHub
            </a>
          </div>
          
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
            Or subscribe to my newsletter to get the latest posts delivered to your inbox.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>